                        "review": "Since I have a low-end system, I look for games that are not very demanding—ensuring that even those with modest hardware can enjoy them. I highly recommend this game! I initially played it just to earn achievements and get the platinum trophy, but I ended up truly falling in love with it. It is a very lightweight 2D game that uses random events to keep things engaging and can keep you entertained for hours.",
